    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαισ-τήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> and ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαίω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smasher</i>, i.e.
			<i>hammer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.477
			</span></i> (fem.), <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				59
			</span></i>; masc. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.117
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pancrat.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">με χρύσειον ἀπὸ ῥαιστῆρος
				στήσητε</span> set up a statue of me in <i>beaten</i>
			gold, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.5
			</span></i>:—found in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.121
			</span></i> P. (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			generally, <i>destroyer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαλὸς ῥ. μεγάρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.120
				</span></i>
			.</div>
